    <string name="setup_permissions_title">Permissions NEXUS needs</string>
    <string name="setup_permissions_body">1. Network access, to keep an outbound connection to your own server.\n2. The accessibility service, which you enable yourself in Android Settings. It lets NEXUS read the visible screen and tap, scroll and type on your behalf.\n\nNEXUS never runs without your instruction, never stores your passwords, and never bypasses a lock screen or a security check.</string>
